    "updated_at": "2022-10-21T07:36:42Z",
    "body": "This seems reasonable as an underpinning for High Resolution Time and specifications that need time without exposing it to script. We should point out that for script-exposed times https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time and friends are to be used instead.\r\n\r\ncc @noamr @yoavweiss",
