    "created_at": "2022-10-21T14:29:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-21T14:32:23Z",
    "body": "I did add the advice to use DOMHighResTimeStamp when interchanging times with scripts, mention the issue with decreasing nows, and link to the monotonic clock for more details. I wouldn't be opposed to saying that instants have clocks in this PR, but I don't want to get into anything more about what clocks are.",
